WEBVTT

00:00:58.454 --> 00:01:00.426
"You cannot be serious!"

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:05.357
Now, I can't do the accent, but I am serious,

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:09.357
thanks to these two children,

00:01:09.357 --> 00:01:13.037
who, as you'll learn, are very much at the heart

00:01:13.037 --> 00:01:15.529
of my talk.

00:01:15.529 --> 00:01:18.495
On the left, we have Pia.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:20.085
She lives in England.

00:01:20.085 --> 00:01:23.229
She has two loving parents,

00:01:23.229 --> 00:01:28.129
one of whom is standing right here.

00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:30.521
Dorothy, on the right,